libcoap 4.3.5, upstream tag v4.3.5.
Source: https://github.com/obgm/libcoap/archive/refs/tags/v4.3.5.tar.gz
License: BSD-2-Clause and bundled component notices; see LICENSE and COPYING.
Upstream source is unchanged. Nubia Link builds it statically without DTLS,
examples, documentation, upstream tests, OSCORE or proxy support. It supplies
COAP_RXBUFFER_SIZE=10240 through the public target compile definitions.
The NX721J sends one 2342-byte UDP discovery datagram, while Ubuntu's packaged
libcoap uses a 1472-byte receive buffer. Runtime MTU changes cannot increase
that compiled receive buffer. No system library is replaced.
